sequenceDiagram
    actor F as Freelancer
    participant UI as Job details page
    participant API as Backend
    participant G as Skill graph
    F->>UI: Click Apply
    UI->>API: GET /proposals/eligibility/:jobId
    API->>API: Load verified, non-expired skills
    API->>G: Does a verified skill cover a required skill or the category?
    G-->>API: Yes or no (exact, alias, ancestor, similar)
    API->>API: Is the verified level at least the job's required level?
    API-->>UI: allowed or not, with required skills and level
    alt Allowed
        UI->>F: Open the proposal form
        F->>API: Submit proposal
        API->>API: Re-check the same gate on the server
        API-->>F: Proposal created
    else Not allowed
        UI->>F: Explain why and offer the skill test
        F->>UI: Take the test and pass
        UI->>F: Return to the job and reopen the form
    end
